{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "c6daba7955c74bcfc54db131a9cb9730ab43319634cb3ac469200fd0b3c0cf5b", "ja": "みんなフルスロットル！", "zh": "全员全开油门！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "56949e79b23dd03df56561e268669d48c1666618eb40c24d115e11dce8717f72", "ja": "公演が近づき、プロデューサーも忙しくなっ\nてきた。そんなところに、自主練の許可を求\nめて次々にやってくるメンバー達。全力で頑\n張るアイドル達の姿に感化され、プロデュー\nサーもやる気満々！", "zh": "公演临近，制作人也越来越忙碌\n起来。就在这时，成员们一个接一个地赶来，请求\n获准自主练习。被全力以赴努力的偶像们的身影\n感染，制作人也\n干劲十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c4c23e2b5e69a4aee41f8d7f191aa54cdadde8d1fa335d57a7526b169f5056df", "ja": "（ふぅ……ツアー公演が近づいて、\n残業も多くなってきた。でも、やりがいがあるな！）", "zh": "（呼……巡演公演临近了，加班也变多了。不过，还是很有成就感的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "7ca21d44d324a95bb1989168a3a57132aa800a25b40a15ad2d1dba58893ec41d", "ja": "{$P$}！　お疲れさまなの～。\nミキが会いに来てあげたよ、元気出た？", "zh": "{$P$}！辛苦了哦～  \n美希来见你了，有精神起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "1e778fd8027e5cfdebad1d892fbec23efd2fbbae701f64c3fe2e862af0f5fba0", "ja": "さんさんさんさん、{$P$}さん～。\n太陽みたいな、人気者さん～♪", "zh": "闪闪闪闪，{$P$}先生～。\n像太阳一样的人气偶像～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "92df970130fe18d4bd3f462330a6d3595b1712073e389296e16d1b55d6b344d7", "ja": "あれ？　お疲れさま。\nみんな、まだ残ってたのか。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？辛苦了。\n大家居然都还没走啊，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d04ee6a8f3de95019a6eb816b5229a23bcdcf7ec8943ef65d19b18da788b2e18", "ja": "へへっ！　実はこれから、自主練しようって話に\nなってさ。レッスンルーム、使わせてもらっていい？", "zh": "嘿嘿！其实我们正打算接下来自己练习。可以让我们用一下练习室吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2409256caa208668da9bf887b221bb77a61d5f63a7c3b75fcf07dd4b3a73c4f4", "ja": "これから？　遅くないか？", "zh": "现在？会不会太晚了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "3f2ef974082e09b2e042a2779a06cc1b22e58b68082ef89cd38ceff63a2dc94f", "ja": "えへへっ、大丈夫でーす！\nちゃんとお家には、連絡しておきましたから！", "zh": "嘿嘿，没关系——！\n我已经好好联系过家里了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "c1aee563607df06b0ff9068931a42ff624b79dc895fffe6f4489440f9438dfa8", "ja": "ムフフ♪　遅くまでアイドルちゃんたちと\nレッスン……これは役得ですよ！　ほああああーっ！", "zh": "唔呼呼♪　和偶像们一起练习到这么晚……这可是福利啊！啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "bc15b98dfbdea8f44fe978419ab8458175b7936e1171ff016cc3946f87b68dbc", "ja": "亜利沙、うるさいの。", "zh": "亚利沙，吵死了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "a679ae0cd91e4d72628a79c1c539e162e403becb2095c9438898d73b05e82230", "ja": "ひゃあああ！　美希ちゃんの「うるさい」、\nいただきました～♪　ムホッ！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊！美希说的“好吵”，我收到啦～♪ 呜哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "e56b3c8f90dbd96098ab443e29760cd531e83b8ca8647d2ef9a443a8ace7b976", "ja": "もっとうるさくなっちゃったの……。", "zh": "变得更吵了啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6d9ab43d1899e5bfbecef166de2fad693214ba228690ebe9325ae8451a948c11", "ja": "ふむ……まあ、少しならいいよ。\nけど、くれぐれもオーバーワークはダメだからな？", "zh": "嗯……好吧，稍微一点倒是可以。\n不过，千万不能过度劳累啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e585de21cd9a55931a93442b4c8a1eb8406738ea0d5b8346b607bf6cd2c41fe9", "ja": "任せてよ、{$P$}！\n年長者のアタシが、無理はさせないからさ。", "zh": "交给我吧，{$P$}！\n我可是年长者，不会让你勉强自己的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "07986d60dd90dc2c9e9d97c3d2c44f3ae94e39994141e8fe997b2a6ca17fc357", "ja": "うん、そういうことなら、よろしく。\nみんなも、歩の言うとおりにな。", "zh": "嗯，既然这样，就拜托你了。\n大家也都要听步的话啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "a85364b566e78be565bd7da3a7d20a6586b30eda5f9aeb6eca3f26dbdb5265d5", "ja": "はーいっ！　やったー！\n自主レッスン～♪　がんばりまっすん～♪", "zh": "好——！太好了！\n自主练习～♪我会加油的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "cc78aed3f84688fe9e59c8a85f5302288f6dd9c4ed4bce57e0b62b1e3372787c", "ja": "それじゃ、ミキたち行くね。\n{$P$}も、あんまり無理しないでね？", "zh": "那么，美希我们就先走啦。\n{$P$}也别太勉强自己哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "df44150d69bd6ac3ff32d5099ac5aaaece3bd55fabb0d8e21be9432c61ebd4da", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "42408b6192a9d270d7909c93e8a3bf031fc6e35a69b2b2f0d42ada0caeadaca8", "ja": "よーしっ！　それじゃ、まだ上手く合わないとこ、\n詰めちゃおうよ！　レッツゴー！", "zh": "好——！那么，把还没配合好的地方再练练吧！出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "09dff3f13d44d4741f919539ce01caa2ef9923e8b7ad62fe0cf0e53192b20f6a", "ja": "うっ……ありさ、\nダンスはまだ、ほぼ全部合わないんですけど……。", "zh": "呜……可是，舞蹈几乎还完全合不上拍呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "0cb788c814b22986566d7029ce445c6e99f4e2de586970b697300e6bf6e34aac", "ja": "でもでも、それだけみんなと一緒にいられるって\nことですから！　ふおぉ、ポジティブ、ポジティブ！", "zh": "不过不过，这也说明我还能和大家一起待在一起嘛！呜哦哦，要积极，要积极！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "63d53de822e8a2a318c2421a927739a215d30ea98a7eb11ff295695ff9d4db99", "ja": "（みんなに当てられたか、こっちも燃えてきた……。\nよーし！　残業、めちゃくちゃに頑張るぞ！）", "zh": "（被大家这么一鼓舞，我也燃起来了……。好！加班也要拼命努力了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
